[I] Standalone version of AFDKO's autohinter

[T] psautohint is a standalone version of the autohinter of the Adobe Font
[T] Development Kit for OpenType (AFDKO). It consists of a core autohinter
[T] written in C, a Python C extension providing an interface to it, and
[T] helper Python code to hint OpenType and UFO fonts.

[U] https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/psautohint

[A] Psautohint Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

